### Faiz Türlerini Getir
GET http://localhost:5000/api/Installment/interest-types

### Taksit Hesaplama - Yıllık Faiz
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Installment/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 0.12,
  "interestType": 1,
  "totalInstallments": 12
}

### Taksit Hesaplama - Aylık Faiz
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Installment/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 0.12,
  "interestType": 2,
  "totalInstallments": 12
}

### Faiz Türleri Karşılaştırması
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Installment/calculate-comparison
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 0.12,
  "totalInstallments": 12
}

### Yeni Taksit Oluştur - Yıllık Faiz
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Installment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 0.12,
  "interestType": 1,
  "totalInstallments": 12,
  "nextPaymentDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Yeni Taksit Oluştur - Aylık Faiz
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Installment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "originalAmount": 10000,
  "interestRate": 0.12,
  "interestType": 2,
  "totalInstallments": 12,
  "nextPaymentDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00Z"
}
